# skill-contract: the reference checker's conformance vectors are compared
# byte-for-byte against build_vectors.py's output (LF), and every vendored
# contract_check.py must stay byte-identical to the reference. Pin LF in the
# working tree on every platform, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# does not rewrite them as CRLF.
docs/skill-contract/vectors/** text eol=lf
docs/skill-contract/reference/*.py text eol=lf
*/assets/contract_check.py text eol=lf
